---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/paths';
---

<MainLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure — SAVRIVO" description="SAVRIVO's full affiliate disclosure. We earn commissions through affiliate programmes." canonicalUrl="https://savrivo.in/affiliate-disclosure">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="container-content max-w-3xl">
      <nav class="text-xs mb-6" style="color: var(--color-text-2)">
        <a href={url('/')} class="hover:underline">Home</a> <span class="mx-2">›</span>
        <span style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Affiliate Disclosure</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-8" style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-base max-w-none space-y-5" style="color: var(--color-text-2)">
        <p><strong style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Last updated: November 2024</strong></p>
        <p>SAVRIVO ("we", "us", "our") participates in affiliate marketing programmes. This means that when you click certain links on our site and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>

        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Programmes We Participate In</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Amazon Associates:</strong> SAVRIVO is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program (and its Indian equivalent), an affiliate advertising programme designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.in.</li>
          <li><strong style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Flipkart Affiliate Programme:</strong> Where applicable, links to Flipkart may be affiliate links.</li>
          <li>Other authorized affiliate programmes as we expand.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">How Affiliate Links Work</h2>
        <p>Affiliate links contain a tracking parameter (such as an associate tag) that allows the retailer to identify that a visitor came from SAVRIVO. If that visitor makes a qualifying purchase, we receive a commission.</p>
        <p>Prices and availability are determined by the retailer, not SAVRIVO. We do not set, control, or guarantee prices.</p>

        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Editorial Independence</h2>
        <p>Our affiliate relationships do not influence our editorial recommendations. Products are selected based on relevance and usefulness, not commission rates. We do not accept paid placements in editorial content.</p>

        <h2 style="color: var(--color-text-1)">Questions</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about our affiliate relationships, please <a href={url('/contact')} style="color: var(--color-accent)">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

